or evaluating faithfulness (prompt-following) of\ntext-to-image models, drawn from real, hard arena user requests — long, multi-entity\nprompts with attributes, spatial relations, counts, and stylistic constraints. Each\nprompt ships pre-decomposed into a dependency-aware DAG of yes/no questions; when\nscoring an image, failing a parent question zeroes out its descendants. The benchmark\nstays discriminative where DPG-Bench and DSG… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/lmarena-ai/Arena-T2I-Hard.","downloads":85,"tags":["task_categories:text-to-image","language:en","license:mit","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","arxiv:2606.31711","region:us","text-to-image","faithfulness","benchmark","evaluation","prompt-following"],"createdAt":"2026-06-30T17:00:29.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a63b722a3424bbb89618337","id":"RexTRO111/Claude-GPT-LMArena-mega-Dataset","author":"RexTRO111","cardData":{"license":"apache-2.0"},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-07-25T11:09:20.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"d2447b15a2f859195a4186d5c89f994d69ba8303","downloads":13,"tags":["license:apache-2.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us"],"createdAt":"2026-07-24T19:04:02.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a650c17f31e79c78d9fbef8","id":"RexTRO111/LMArena-SFT-Winners-Rextro","author":"RexTRO111","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-nc-4.0","task_categories":["text-generation"],"language":["en","es","zh","ja","ru","pt","ko","pl","ro","fr","it","id"],"tags":["alignment","sft","instruction-tuning","lmarena","battle-mode"],"pretty_name":"LMArena SFT Winners","dataset_info":{"features":[{"name":"messages","list":[{"name":"role","dtype":"string"},{"name":"content","dtype":"string"}]}]}},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-07-28T10:56:55.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"b57c40273133978ba6df01371e33d013b34c6562","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Card for LMArena-SFT-Winners ⚔️\n\t\n\nLMArena-SFT-Winners is a curated Supervised Fine-Tuning (SFT) dataset containing multi-turn conversations and single-turn prompts where the model responses consist strictly of winning outputs selected from head-to-head battles in Battle Mode. \nBy filtering out losing completions, this dataset provides high-quality target completions filtered by human preference for direct instruction tuning and alignment.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Structure… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/RexTRO111/LMArena-SFT-Winners-Rextro.","downloads":33,"tags":["task_categories:text-generation","language:en","language:es","language:zh","language:ja","language:ru","language:pt","language:ko","language:pl","language:ro","language:fr","language:it","language:id","license:cc-by-nc-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","alignment","sft","instruction-tuning","lmarena","battle-mode"],"createdAt":"2026-07-25T19:18:47.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a688958ba2f27c17db65311","id":"RexTRO111/lmarena-dataset","author":"RexTRO111","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0"},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-07-28T10:50:49.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"40042305cff968a5f6a9bc6c8b8a47181f0e47c7","downloads":17,"tags":["license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us"],"createdAt":"2026-07-28T10:50:00.000Z","key":""}]